 "remarks": "Welcome to 61 Center Drive, a move-in-ready Old Greenwich home at the end of a cul de sac. Thoughtfully updated across two levels, this 5-bedroom, 3-full bath home offers approximately 2,300 square feet with bright gathering spaces, renovated finishes, and multiple areas to work, host, or just relax. The main level features hardwood floors, a newly updated kitchen that easily flows into a spacious dining and living room overlooking the foyer with generous natural light. Three bedrooms and two newly renovated full bathrooms complete this level. The finished lower level adds meaningful versatility with a spacious bedroom, renovated full bathroom, fireside recreation room, and an additional flex room that can function as a bedroom, office, gym, or playroom.",
